 src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/orange-pi.png
Copyright: Shenzhen Xunlong Software Co., Ltd.
License: trademark
 The Orange Pi orange is a trademark of Shenzhen Xunlong Software Co.,
 Ltd. It is drawn only on the label of hardware that is an Orange Pi, to
 identify it. From the Orange Pi GitHub account avatar, cropped to the
 fruit and with its ink deepened for print (the shapes untouched); see
 src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

