Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/tinytapeout.svg
Copyright: Tiny Tapeout LTD
License: trademark
 The circular Tiny Tapeout mark, drawn only on the label of a Tiny Tapeout
 demo board, which Tiny Tapeout made, to identify it. From
 tinytapeout.com/ttlogo.svg, the branding page's black and white SVG; see
 src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/efabless.png
Copyright: Efabless Corporation
License: trademark
 The "efabless.com" wordmark, drawn only on the label of hardware made
 through Efabless, whose chipIgnite shuttles carried Tiny Tapeout TT01 to
 TT09, to identify it. From efabless.com's own header logo as the Internet
 Archive captured it (Efabless ceased trading in 2025), trimmed, scaled
 down and quantised, with the shapes and colours untouched; see
 src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/chipfoundry.png
Copyright: ChipFoundry, Inc.
License: trademark
 The ChipFoundry chip symbol, drawn only on the label of hardware made
 through ChipFoundry, whose chipIgnite shuttles carry Tiny Tapeout's
 sky130 runs since TTSKY25a, to identify it. From the ChipFoundry GitHub
 organisation avatar, the symbol half of the logo on chipfoundry.io,
 trimmed and scaled down; see src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/wafer-space.png
Copyright: Wafer Space
License: trademark
 The wafer.space rocket-and-wafer mark, drawn only on the label of
 hardware made through wafer.space, which runs Tiny Tapeout's
 GlobalFoundries shuttles, to identify it. From the wafer.space GitHub
 organisation avatar, the same symbol the site serves as its favicon,
 trimmed and scaled down; see src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/ihp.svg
Copyright: IHP GmbH - Leibniz-Institut fuer innovative Mikroelektronik
License: trademark
 The IHP mark, drawn only on the label of hardware made by IHP, which
 makes Tiny Tapeout's sg13g2 silicon, to identify it. From IHP's own
 header logo SVG (the "ohne claim" file, without the tagline), with no
 path touched; see src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/skywater.svg
Copyright: SkyWater Technology, Inc.
License: trademark
 The SkyWater symbol, drawn only on the label of hardware made by
 SkyWater, which makes Tiny Tapeout's sky130 silicon, to identify it. From
 SkyWater's own header logo SVG with the wordmark paths removed and the
 viewBox trimmed to the symbol, matching the symbol-only mark SkyWater
 uses as its site icon; the symbol's paths are untouched. See
 src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

Files: src/rpi_hwid/artwork/globalfoundries.svg
Copyright: GlobalFoundries Inc.
License: trademark
 The GF monogram, drawn only on the label of hardware made by
 GlobalFoundries, which makes Tiny Tapeout's gf180mcu silicon, to identify
 it. Copied byte for byte from gf.com's own site icon SVG, GF's
 symbol-only mark; see src/rpi_hwid/artwork/README.md.

